---
// FAQ Component
---

<section class="faq-section">
  <h2 class="faq-main-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Attendance & Invitations</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Can I bring a plus one / date?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Sorry we are very limited on space and can't accommodate plus ones.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Are children welcome?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Sorry we are very limited on space and can't accommodate children.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What if I have accessibility needs?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Please let our wedding planner know, we already have some attendees with
        accessibility needs and have chosen a venue that we expect to be very
        accommodating.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">When is the RSVP deadline?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">[tbd]</p>
    </div> -->
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">The Day Itself</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What is the dress code?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Reasonably formal, weddingy, see this pinterest board for vibes, but
        make sure to wear something you feel comfortable in.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Will the ceremony be indoors or outdoors?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">Outdoors if not raining - bring something warm!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What should I wear on my feet?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        There are some light cobblestones, but nothing extreme.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">
        What's the weather typically like in September?
      </h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        September weather in the Kinder Scout area (based on Met Office Buxton
        data, 1991-2020).
      </p>
      <ul class="faq-answer faq-list">
        <li>
          Temperature: highs around 16°C (61°F), lows around 9°C (48°F).
        </li>
        <li>Rainfall: about 106mm across 13 rainy days.</li>
        <li>Sunshine: around 127 hours for the month (about 4 hours daily).</li>
        <li>
          Wind: average 13 knots, but the exposed plateau will feel windier.
        </li>
        <li>Frost: none expected at this elevation in September.</li>
        <li>
          Source:
          <a
            href="https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/research/climate/maps-and-data/location-specific-long-term-averages/gcqwurrdr"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            metoffice.gov.uk
          </a>
          .
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there parking at the venue?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">No - please park at carpark, [minibus details]</p>
    </div> -->
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Food & Drink</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Will there be vegetarian/vegan options?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">Yes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">
        How do I let you know about dietary restrictions or allergies?
      </h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">Please let us know in the RSVP form.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there an open bar?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">[tbd]</p>
    </div> -->
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Logistics</h3>
    <!--
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What time should I arrive?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">[tbd]</p>
    </div> -->

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there phone signal / Wi-Fi at the venue?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        There is no phone signal, the venue has wifi and we have a starlink dish
        if you need something critical.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">
        Where exactly is Upper House and how do I get there?
      </h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Google maps link, address, note that you should instead park in car park
        - do not park at upper house unless previously arranged with wedding
        planner.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Gifts</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Do you have a gift registry?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">[yes - here]</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Where can gifts be sent?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Gifts can be sent to 143B Milton Road, CB4 1XE or brought on the day
      </p>
    </div>
  </div> -->

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Photos & Social Media</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Can I take photos during the ceremony?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Please don't take photos during the ceremony - we have a photographer,
        please feel free to take photos whenever else, though we want people to
        live in the moment and have an amazing photographer to make sure we
        don't lose the special moments.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there a wedding hashtag?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">Hell no.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-section {
    max-width: 87.5rem;
    width: 88%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .faq-main-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
    color: #111;
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .faq-category {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #111;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .faq-category-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .faq-item {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
  }

  .faq-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .faq-question {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    color: #111;
  }

  .faq-answer {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    color: #333;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .faq-section {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0 1rem;
      margin: 4rem auto 3rem;
    }

    .faq-main-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .faq-category {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .faq-category-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .faq-item {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .faq-question {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }
</style>
